#. ~ Description of furniture "open metal crate"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-storage.json
msgid ""
"This large metal crate's lid is unsealed, and hinges open easily to reveal a "
"number of storage shelves inside.  Once open, the side panels also swing "
"wider for easy access."
msgstr ""

